<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001B_S000A" variety="S000A">
<name>Wiper &amp; Washer</name>
<ttl id="1001B_S000A_7421O_T001Y" variety="T001Y">
<name>Windshield Wiper Switch Assembly</name>
<para id="RM000001Z24004X" category="G" type-id="8000T" name-id="611DJ-00" from="200612">
<name>On-vehicle Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000001Z24004X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000001Z24004X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00000V600000">
<ptxt>Inspect Windshield Wiper Switch Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Intermittent Operation Inspection (Front Wiper)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E136492J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and set the front wiper switch to INT.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between terminals B2 (+1) and A2 (EW) when the intermittent wiper relay is operated.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>With the connector connected, inspect from the back of the connector.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>As shown in the illustration</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E136493J03" width="7.106578999in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Operation Inspection (Front Washer)</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and turn the front wiper switch OFF.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), connect the SST positive terminal to terminal B2 (+1) and the SST negative terminal to terminal A2 (EW) of the connector, and measure the voltage between terminals B2 (+1) and A2 (EW) when the washer switch is turned ON and OFF.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>With the connector connected, inspect from the back of the connector.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>As shown in the illustration</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E136494J02" width="7.106578999in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
